{
  "title": "业务错误信封 + 当前版本回报 {ok:false,error:{code,message,fields}}",
  "description": "乐观锁冲突（EMR_CHANGED）专用的错误信封：除 code/message 外还带 error.fields，如实回报**服务端当前那一版**（updated_at / updated_by / record_id），让客户端能重新读取并合并，而不是盲重试覆盖别人的修改。⚠ 只有冲突这条路带 fields —— 其余错误一律用 envelope-error（它禁止额外成员），这样“多带字段”本身也是可被门禁发现的契约变更。样例里的三个值已归一化为 0。",
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["ok", "error"],
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
    "ok": { "const": false },
    "error": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["code", "message", "fields"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "code": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "message": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "fields": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["updated_at", "updated_by", "record_id"],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "updated_at": { "type": "integer" },
            "updated_by": { "type": "integer" },
            "record_id": { "type": "integer" }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
